# TypeScript

- End statements with semicolons.
- Put a blank line before and after `if`, `for`, `while`, and `try` blocks, unless the block is the first or last line of its parent.
- Do not abbreviate names unless the abbreviation is common (`i`, `j`, `id`, `config`).
- Prefix unused parameters with `_`.
- Mark class members `readonly` when they are never reassigned.
